+Thus every contiguous three-sample-index window has one of each role. An explicit
+`scene_profile` override bypasses this schedule and retains the prior override
+contract.
+
+The contrastive role is accepted only when its intended output differs from all
+119 declared competitors: 24 anchor-color/rotation assignments crossed with five
+collision/order policies, minus the intended assignment with intended
+row-major-max merging. `lesson_identifiable` means no declared competitor both
+fits every demonstration and changes the query output. It is a finite audit, not
+a proof over all possible rules.
+
+Do not weaken `strict_canonical_like`; it remains exact translated canonical
+membership. Do not remove the dedicated canonical schedule role without replacing
+its deterministic support guarantee. The first contrastive-only reservation
+passed focused tests but failed inherited `profile_floor` at 10/60 (16.7%).
